==============================================================================
==============================================================================
  VI. TROUBLESHOOTING
==============================================================================
==============================================================================

We would like to know about any bug found in this release. 
Please send a mail to:

xquad-bugs@axene.com       for XQuad
xclamation-bugs@axene.com  for Xclamation
xallwrite-bugs@axene.com   for XAllWrite
xmayday-bugs@axene.com     for XMayday

Do not forget to note your software and hardware environment, as well as the 
release number of the application concerned.

In you mail, add the result of the following commands
(don't forget to substitute SOFTWARE_NAME by one of 
 XAllWrite, Xclamation, XMayday, XQuad)

$ SOFTWARE_NAME -v
$ uname -a

If you have a screen problem, add:
$ xdpyinfo

If you have a problem with your key, send us the result of the following
command: 
$ SOFTWARE_NAME -ck


If you have a problem with small fonts display try to launch the software
with the '-xbp' parameter.
If you have a problem with lines display in vector based drawing try to launch
the software with the '-xbl' parameter.
If you have a problem with images display try to launch the software with the 
'-nsp' parameter.



